id: TEST-016
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 4
action: advisory
title: Hardcoded port in test
category: quality
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .test.ts .test.js .spec.ts .spec.js _test.go
  exclude_paths: .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: it(
patterns:
  - regex: (listen|port|PORT).*\b(3000|8080|8000|5000|4200)\b
    message: "Hardcoded port in test — use port 0 (random) to avoid CI conflicts"
fix: Use port 0 to let the OS assign a random available port. Read the actual port from the server after it starts.
